Car_1pt_Motion_3D: signed high-half reads of the GTE position pair (sar semantics)

asm 0x4400a7/0x4400b6: mov edi,[ebp-0x1e]; sar edi,0x10 (and esi,[ebp-0x1a]) --
the velocity delta uses the SIGN-EXTENDED high shorts of the packed GTE result.
Ghidra typed local_22/local_1e as undefined4, so the C `>> 0x10` was a logical
shift: negative screen/world deltas turned into +65xxx values. Affects both
targets identically (not a native/wasm splitter) but diverges from the original
= reference-faithfulness bug (unsigned/paired-load class, same family as the
dth_* sar fixes).

